# Secret material: never written, and never read, by agents, in every repo where the plugin is installed
# (bash glob syntax, relative to the repo root; `*` crosses `/`). Extend in .aiops/config/secret-paths.
# Read by hooks/guard-files.sh and hooks/guard-read.sh. Templates (.env.example|.sample|.template) are allowed.
.env* secrets/env files
*/.env* secrets/env files
secrets/* secret material
*.pem secret material
*.key secret material
*id_rsa* secret material
*/secrets/* secret material
*id_ed25519* private SSH key
*id_ecdsa* private SSH key
*id_dsa* private SSH key
*/.ssh/* SSH material
*/.aws/credentials cloud credentials
*/.netrc credentials
.netrc credentials
*/.npmrc registry token
.npmrc registry token
